/-- Arithmetic frame of block `j`: `s = 75+15j`, `2h+s ∈ {512,513}`, `3 < Wp`, `Wp+h ≤ 242`. -/
theorem frame (j : Fin 23) : start j=75+15*j.val ∧ j.val<23 ∧ 2*sbP (start j)+start j≤513 ∧
